{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 1,
  "name": {
    "ja": "盗賊の隠れ家",
    "en": "Thieves Hideout",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 5,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "強盗たちが街の人々を襲っています！彼らは城壁の外の小さな",
          "塚に住んでいて、街道を行く人々を襲うのです。あげくの果てに",
          "は街に潜んで金品を強奪しています。どうか彼らの隠れ家",
          "に行って悪党どもを倒して来て下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "There are thieves robbing my people! They live in a small",
          "burrow outside the city walls robbing people as they pass",
          "on the roads. They even sneak inside the town to mug and",
          "pillage! Your task is to go to the burrow and kill these",
          "ruffians.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "盗賊どもを退治して下さって有難うございます！",
          "ささやかなお礼を外に用意しておきました。",
        ],
        "en": ["Thank you for killing the band of thieves! A small reward", "awaits you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "この仕事はあなたには難しかったようですね。他の冒険者を雇って",
          "残りの盗賊を退治しますから、もういいですよ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "It seems like this task was too difficult for you.  Good that I",
          "hired another adventurer to clean up the remaining thieves.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
  "legend": {
    "a": {
      "terrain": "FLOOR",
      "caveInfo": ["ROOM"],
      "monster": 44,
    },
    "b": {
      "terrain": "FLOOR",
      "caveInfo": ["ROOM"],
      "monster": 150,
    },
  },
